{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53942","headline":"依韵奉酬悟真大德（题拟） · 辨章","name":"依韵奉酬悟真大德（题拟）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"生居忠正地，远慕凤凰城。\n已见三冬学，何言徒聚萤？\n（伯三七二○卷。\n原附悟真诗後，题作「依韵奉酬」。\n其署衔爲「右街千福寺三教首座入内讲论赐紫大德」。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"辨章","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53942.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53942","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}